                    "## Road 与 vehicle 对冻结量化扰动最敏感\n\n"
                    "W4A4 相对 FP-QIF 的整体 mIoU 下降 **33.26 个百分点**。Road IoU 下降 **53.65 个百分点（相对下降 84.0%）**，vehicle 下降 **38.82 个百分点（71.1%）**；vegetation 的相对下降仅 **15.5%**。"
                ),
            },
            {"id": "class-chart-block", "type": "chart", "chartId": "chart-class", "layout": "full"},
            {
                "id": "scope",
                "type": "markdown",
                "sourceId": "derived-analysis",
                "body": (
                    "## 口径与统计方法\n\n"
                    "分析覆盖 UDD6 validation 的 8,478 个 patch、35 个原始 source cluster、78 个实际触发的 QIF 层。主指标先在每个 source 内对层等权平均，再对 source 等权平均；95% CI 通过按 source 聚类重采样 10,000 次获得。"
                    "微平均只用于说明逐元素扰动形态，不能替代预注册的等层权宏平均。A4-input 是历史 operator-input fake quantization，并不等价于将 Integer-LIF 输出改为连续 A32。"
                ),
            },
            {
                "id": "limitations",
                "type": "markdown",
                "sourceId": "derived-analysis",
                "body": (
                    "## 限制与稳健性边界\n\n"
                    "这是单个冻结 checkpoint、单数据集、T=1 的干预式诊断，不是经过独立训练的 W32A32/W4A32/W32A4/W4A4 比较。35 个 source 上，W4A4 D 均高于 W4 和 A4-input；但 MAE 的联合交互项为负，且所有 source 均为负，因此不能声称 superadditive coupled distortion。"
                    "相关性在同一批 source 上计算，可能受类别组成和场景难度混杂，只能解释为共变。零值与饱和统计能够排除若干候选机制，但还不能单独证明 QAD 修复了 Decoder 6。"
                ),
            },
            {
                "id": "next",
                "type": "markdown",
                "sourceId": "derived-analysis",
                "body": (
                    "## 下一步：用相同 probe 比较训练后的 QAT、KD 与 QAD\n\n"
                    "最有信息量的后续不是继续扩大位宽扫描，而是固定初始化、训练预算和 teacher，对 task-only STE-QAT、generic KD 和 QAD 的 checkpoint 重复本统计。"
                    "预先指定三个共同终点：全网 D/MAE、Decoder 6 的 signed error 与 zero-rate delta、以及 road/vehicle IoU。只有 QAD 同时修复局部统计和任务指标，才可把当前 distortion 提升为方法特异性的证据链。"
                ),
            },
            {
                "id": "questions",
                "type": "markdown",
                "body": (
                    "## 仍待回答的问题\n\n"
                    "- Decoder 6 的负向漂移是由上采样、skip fusion、局部阈值，还是权重误差累积触发？\n"
                    "- QAD 是否减少的是翻转数量，还是优先修复语义敏感位置？\n"
                    "- 该层级方向反转能否在第二 seed 或第二模型复现？"
                ),
            },
        ],
    }
    snapshot = {
        "version": 1,
        "generatedAt": generated_at,
        "status": "ready",
        "datasets": {
            "headline": rounded_records(headline),
            "stage_chart": rounded_records(stage_chart),
            "full_stage": rounded_records(full_stage),
            "top_layers": rounded_records(top_layers),
            "source_scatter": rounded_records(source_scatter),
            "class_long": rounded_records(class_long),
            "representation": rounded_records(representation),
            "correlations": rounded_records(correlations),
        },
    }
    artifact = {
        "surface": "report",
        "manifest": manifest,
        "snapshot": snapshot,
        "sources": [source],
    }
    (HERE / "artifact.json").write_text(
        json.dumps(artifact, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + "\n",
        encoding="utf-8",
    )


def run(write_notebook: bool = True) -> None:
    rng = np.random.default_rng(BOOTSTRAP_SEED)
    summary = json.loads((RESULT_DIR / "summary.json").read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
    manifest = json.loads((RESULT_DIR / "manifest.json").read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
    source_layer = pd.DataFrame(
        json.loads((RESULT_DIR / "source_layer_aggregates.json").read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
    )
    source_layer["source_id"] = source_layer["source_id"].astype(str).str.zfill(6)
    rate_columns = {
        "disagreement": "disagreement_count",
        "mae": "abs_error_sum",
        "signed_error": "signed_error_sum",
        "zero_reference": "reference_zero_count",
        "zero_variant": "variant_zero_count",
        "saturation_reference": "reference_saturation_count",
        "saturation_variant": "variant_saturation_count",
    }
    for rate, count in rate_columns.items():
        source_layer[rate] = source_layer[count] / source_layer["count"]
    source_layer["zero_delta"] = source_layer["zero_variant"] - source_layer["zero_reference"]
    source_layer["saturation_delta"] = (
        source_layer["saturation_variant"] - source_layer["saturation_reference"]
    )
    source_layer["stage"] = source_layer["layer"].map(stage_for_layer)
    if set(source_layer["stage"]) - set(STAGE_ORDER):
        raise RuntimeError(f"Unmapped stages: {set(source_layer['stage']) - set(STAGE_ORDER)}")

    metric_columns = [
        "disagreement",
        "mae",
        "signed_error",
        "zero_reference",
        "zero_variant",
        "zero_delta",
        "saturation_reference",
        "saturation_variant",
        "saturation_delta",
    ]
    source_mode = source_layer.groupby(["mode", "source_id"], as_index=False)[metric_columns].mean()
    representation_rows: list[dict[str, object]] = []
    for mode in VARIANT_MODES:
        rows = source_mode.query("mode == @mode")
        raw = source_layer.query("mode == @mode")
        d_ci = bootstrap_mean(rows["disagreement"].to_numpy(), rng)
        mae_ci = bootstrap_mean(rows["mae"].to_numpy(), rng)
        signed_ci = bootstrap_mean(rows["signed_error"].to_numpy(), rng)
        zero_delta_ci = bootstrap_mean(rows["zero_delta"].to_numpy(), rng)
        saturation_delta_ci = bootstrap_mean(rows["saturation_delta"].to_numpy(), rng)
        micro_disagreement = float(raw["disagreement_count"].sum() / raw["count"].sum())
        conditional_step = float(raw["abs_error_sum"].sum() / raw["disagreement_count"].sum())
        representation_rows.append(
            {
                "mode": mode,
                "mode_label": MODE_LABELS[mode],
                "source_count": int(rows.shape[0]),
                "layer_count": int(raw["layer"].nunique()),
                "macro_disagreement": float(rows["disagreement"].mean()),
                "disagreement_ci_low": d_ci[0],
                "disagreement_ci_high": d_ci[1],
                "source_std_disagreement": float(rows["disagreement"].std(ddof=1)),
                "source_cv_disagreement": float(rows["disagreement"].std(ddof=1) / rows["disagreement"].mean()),
                "micro_disagreement": micro_disagreement,
                "macro_mae": float(rows["mae"].mean()),
                "mae_ci_low": mae_ci[0],
                "mae_ci_high": mae_ci[1],
                "micro_conditional_abs_step": conditional_step,
                "single_step_fraction_lower_bound": max(0.0, 2.0 - conditional_step),
                "macro_signed_error": float(rows["signed_error"].mean()),
                "signed_ci_low": signed_ci[0],
                "signed_ci_high": signed_ci[1],
                "signed_to_mae_ratio": float(rows["signed_error"].mean() / rows["mae"].mean()),
                "macro_zero_reference": float(rows["zero_reference"].mean()),
                "macro_zero_variant": float(rows["zero_variant"].mean()),
                "macro_zero_delta": float(rows["zero_delta"].mean()),
                "zero_delta_ci_low": zero_delta_ci[0],
                "zero_delta_ci_high": zero_delta_ci[1],
                "macro_saturation_reference": float(rows["saturation_reference"].mean()),
                "macro_saturation_variant": float(rows["saturation_variant"].mean()),
                "macro_saturation_delta": float(rows["saturation_delta"].mean()),
                "saturation_delta_ci_low": saturation_delta_ci[0],
                "saturation_delta_ci_high": saturation_delta_ci[1],
            }
        )
    representation = pd.DataFrame(representation_rows)

    source_stage = source_layer.groupby(["mode", "source_id", "stage"], as_index=False)[metric_columns].mean()
    stage_rows: list[dict[str, object]] = []
    layer_counts = source_layer.groupby("stage")["layer"].nunique().to_dict()
    full_total = 0.0
    full_stage_numerators: dict[str, float] = {}
    for stage in STAGE_ORDER:
        value = float(
            source_stage.query("mode == 'w4a4_input_qif' and stage == @stage")["disagreement"].mean()
        ) * int(layer_counts[stage])
        full_stage_numerators[stage] = value
        full_total += value
    for mode in VARIANT_MODES:
        for stage_index, stage in enumerate(STAGE_ORDER):
            rows = source_stage.query("mode == @mode and stage == @stage")
            d_ci = bootstrap_mean(rows["disagreement"].to_numpy(), rng)
            zero_ci = bootstrap_mean(rows["zero_delta"].to_numpy(), rng)
            signed_ci = bootstrap_mean(rows["signed_error"].to_numpy(), rng)
            row = {
                "mode": mode,
                "mode_label": MODE_LABELS[mode],
                "stage": stage,
                "stage_label": STAGE_LABELS[stage],
                "stage_order": stage_index,
                "layer_count": int(layer_counts[stage]),
                **{column: float(rows[column].mean()) for column in metric_columns},
                "disagreement_ci_low": d_ci[0],
                "disagreement_ci_high": d_ci[1],
                "zero_delta_ci_low": zero_ci[0],
                "zero_delta_ci_high": zero_ci[1],
                "signed_ci_low": signed_ci[0],
                "signed_ci_high": signed_ci[1],
                "distortion_contribution_share": (
                    full_stage_numerators[stage] / full_total if mode == "w4a4_input_qif" else np.nan
                ),
            }
            stage_rows.append(row)
    stage_stats = pd.DataFrame(stage_rows)

    layer_mode = source_layer.groupby(["mode", "layer", "stage"], as_index=False)[metric_columns].mean()
    layer_index = layer_mode[["layer", "stage"]].drop_duplicates().set_index("layer")
    layer_stats = layer_index.copy()
    aliases = {"w4_qif": "w4", "a4_input_qif": "a4", "w4a4_input_qif": "w4a4"}
    for metric, short in [
        ("disagreement", "d"),
        ("mae", "mae"),
        ("signed_error", "signed"),
        ("zero_delta", "zero_delta"),
        ("saturation_delta", "sat_delta"),
    ]:
        pivot = layer_mode.pivot(index="layer", columns="mode", values=metric)
        for mode, alias in aliases.items():
            layer_stats[f"{short}_{alias}"] = pivot[mode]
    layer_stats["delta_d_full_minus_w4"] = layer_stats["d_w4a4"] - layer_stats["d_w4"]
    layer_stats["delta_d_full_minus_a4"] = layer_stats["d_w4a4"] - layer_stats["d_a4"]
    layer_stats["mae_interaction"] = (
        layer_stats["mae_w4a4"] - layer_stats["mae_w4"] - layer_stats["mae_a4"]
    )
    layer_stats["w4a4_distortion_contribution_share"] = layer_stats["d_w4a4"] / layer_stats["d_w4a4"].sum()
    layer_stats = layer_stats.reset_index()

    quantile_rows: list[dict[str, object]] = []
    for mode, alias in aliases.items():
        values = layer_stats[f"d_{alias}"]
        quantile_rows.append(
            {
                "mode": mode,
                "mode_label": MODE_LABELS[mode],
                "minimum": float(values.min()),
                "p10": float(values.quantile(0.10)),
                "q1": float(values.quantile(0.25)),
                "median": float(values.median()),
                "q3": float(values.quantile(0.75)),
                "p90": float(values.quantile(0.90)),
                "maximum": float(values.max()),
                "exact_zero_layer_count": int((values == 0).sum()),
            }
        )
    layer_quantiles = pd.DataFrame(quantile_rows)

    confusion_rows = json.loads((RESULT_DIR / "source_confusion.json").read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
    confusion: dict[tuple[str, str], np.ndarray] = {}
    for row in confusion_rows:
        confusion[(row["mode"], str(row["source_id"]).zfill(6))] = np.asarray(row["matrix"], dtype=np.int64)
    sources = sorted({source for _, source in confusion})
    task_counts = pd.read_csv(RESULT_DIR / "per_patch_task_counts.csv.gz", dtype={"source_id": str})
    task_counts["source_id"] = task_counts["source_id"].str.zfill(6)
    flip = task_counts.groupby(["mode", "source_id"], as_index=False)[
        ["valid_pixel_count", "prediction_flip_count_vs_fp_qif"]
    ].sum()
    flip["prediction_flip_rate"] = (
        flip["prediction_flip_count_vs_fp_qif"] / flip["valid_pixel_count"]
    )
    source_rows: list[dict[str, object]] = []
    source_mode_indexed = source_mode.set_index(["mode", "source_id"])
    flip_indexed = flip.set_index(["mode", "source_id"])
    for source in sources:
        task_by_mode = {
            mode: confusion_metrics(confusion[(mode, source)])[0]
            for mode in ("fp_qif", *VARIANT_MODES)
        }
        row: dict[str, object] = {
            "source_id": source,
            "miou_fp": task_by_mode["fp_qif"],
            "miou_w4": task_by_mode["w4_qif"],
            "miou_a4": task_by_mode["a4_input_qif"],
            "miou_w4a4": task_by_mode["w4a4_input_qif"],
            "miou_drop_w4a4": task_by_mode["fp_qif"] - task_by_mode["w4a4_input_qif"],
        }
        for mode, alias in aliases.items():
            row[f"d_{alias}"] = float(source_mode_indexed.loc[(mode, source), "disagreement"])
            row[f"mae_{alias}"] = float(source_mode_indexed.loc[(mode, source), "mae"])
            row[f"prediction_flip_{alias}"] = float(flip_indexed.loc[(mode, source), "prediction_flip_rate"])
        row["d_full_minus_w4"] = row["d_w4a4"] - row["d_w4"]
        row["d_full_minus_a4"] = row["d_w4a4"] - row["d_a4"]
        row["mae_interaction"] = row["mae_w4a4"] - row["mae_w4"] - row["mae_a4"]
        source_rows.append(row)
    source_stats = pd.DataFrame(source_rows)

    correlation_rows: list[dict[str, object]] = []
    for x, x_label in [("d_w4a4", "W4A4 code disagreement"), ("mae_w4a4", "W4A4 code MAE")]:
        for y, y_label in [
            ("prediction_flip_w4a4", "prediction-flip rate"),
            ("miou_drop_w4a4", "per-source mIoU drop"),
        ]:
            for method, function in [("spearman", spearmanr), ("pearson", pearsonr)]:
                result = function(source_stats[x], source_stats[y])
                ci = bootstrap_correlation(
                    source_stats[x].to_numpy(), source_stats[y].to_numpy(), method, rng
                )
                correlation_rows.append(
                    {
                        "x": x,
                        "x_label": x_label,
                        "y": y,
                        "y_label": y_label,
                        "method": method,
                        "coefficient": float(result.statistic),
                        "p_value": float(result.pvalue),
                        "bootstrap_ci_low": ci[0],
                        "bootstrap_ci_high": ci[1],
                        "source_count": len(sources),
                    }
                )
    correlations = pd.DataFrame(correlation_rows)

    mode_matrices = {
        mode: np.stack([confusion[(mode, source)] for source in sources])
        for mode in ("fp_qif", *VARIANT_MODES)
    }
    class_boot, miou_boot = bootstrap_class_drops(
        mode_matrices["fp_qif"], mode_matrices["w4a4_input_qif"], rng
    )
    task = summary["task"]
    class_rows: list[dict[str, object]] = []
    for index, class_name in enumerate(CLASS_NAMES):
        fp_iou = task["fp_qif"]["per_class_iou"][class_name]
        full_iou = task["w4a4_input_qif"]["per_class_iou"][class_name]
        class_ci = percentile_ci(class_boot[:, index])
        class_rows.append(
            {
                "class": class_name,
                "iou_fp": fp_iou,
                "iou_w4": task["w4_qif"]["per_class_iou"][class_name],
                "iou_a4": task["a4_input_qif"]["per_class_iou"][class_name],
                "iou_w4a4": full_iou,
                "full_drop": fp_iou - full_iou,
                "full_drop_ci_low": class_ci[0],
                "full_drop_ci_high": class_ci[1],
                "relative_full_drop": (fp_iou - full_iou) / fp_iou,
                "full_minus_w4": full_iou - task["w4_qif"]["per_class_iou"][class_name],
            }
        )
    class_stats = pd.DataFrame(class_rows)

    contrast_rows: list[dict[str, object]] = []
    for name, values in [
        ("W4A4 - W4 disagreement", source_stats["d_full_minus_w4"].to_numpy()),
        ("W4A4 - A4-input disagreement", source_stats["d_full_minus_a4"].to_numpy()),
        ("MAE interaction: W4A4 - W4 - A4-input", source_stats["mae_interaction"].to_numpy()),
    ]:
        ci = bootstrap_mean(values, rng)
        positives = int((values > 0).sum())
        nonzero = int((values != 0).sum())
        sign_p = float(binomtest(positives, nonzero, 0.5).pvalue) if nonzero else 1.0
        contrast_rows.append(
            {
                "contrast": name,
                "mean": float(values.mean()),
                "bootstrap_ci_low": ci[0],
                "bootstrap_ci_high": ci[1],
                "source_std": float(values.std(ddof=1)),
                "paired_effect_dz": float(values.mean() / values.std(ddof=1)),
                "positive_sources": positives,
                "source_count": int(values.size),
                "two_sided_exact_sign_p": sign_p,
            }
        )
    contrasts = pd.DataFrame(contrast_rows)

    full_rep = representation.set_index("mode").loc["w4a4_input_qif"]
    decoder56_share = float(
        stage_stats.query(
            "mode == 'w4a4_input_qif' and stage in ['decoder_5', 'decoder_6']"
        )["distortion_contribution_share"].sum()
    )
    top10_share = float(
        layer_stats.nlargest(10, "d_w4a4")["w4a4_distortion_contribution_share"].sum()
    )
    layer_delta = layer_stats["delta_d_full_minus_w4"]
    layer_sign_counts = {
        "positive": int((layer_delta > 0).sum()),
        "negative": int((layer_delta < 0).sum()),
        "zero": int((layer_delta == 0).sum()),
    }
    rho_flip_row = correlations.query(
        "x == 'd_w4a4' and y == 'prediction_flip_w4a4' and method == 'spearman'"
    ).iloc[0]
    rho_miou_row = correlations.query(
        "x == 'd_w4a4' and y == 'miou_drop_w4a4' and method == 'spearman'"
    ).iloc[0]
    findings = {
        "full_macro_disagreement": float(full_rep["macro_disagreement"]),
        "full_disagreement_ci": [float(full_rep["disagreement_ci_low"]), float(full_rep["disagreement_ci_high"])],
        "full_micro_disagreement": float(full_rep["micro_disagreement"]),
        "full_conditional_abs_step": float(full_rep["micro_conditional_abs_step"]),
        "full_single_step_lower_bound": float(full_rep["single_step_fraction_lower_bound"]),
        "full_signed_error": float(full_rep["macro_signed_error"]),
        "full_signed_ci": [float(full_rep["signed_ci_low"]), float(full_rep["signed_ci_high"])],
        "full_zero_delta": float(full_rep["macro_zero_delta"]),
        "full_zero_delta_ci": [float(full_rep["zero_delta_ci_low"]), float(full_rep["zero_delta_ci_high"])],
        "full_saturation_delta": float(full_rep["macro_saturation_delta"]),
        "full_saturation_delta_ci": [float(full_rep["saturation_delta_ci_low"]), float(full_rep["saturation_delta_ci_high"])],
        "decoder_5_6_distortion_share": decoder56_share,
        "top_10_layer_distortion_share": top10_share,
        "layer_delta_full_minus_w4_sign_counts": layer_sign_counts,
        "source_disagreement_range": [float(source_stats["d_w4a4"].min()), float(source_stats["d_w4a4"].max())],
        "source_miou_drop_range": [float(source_stats["miou_drop_w4a4"].min()), float(source_stats["miou_drop_w4a4"].max())],
        "rho_disagreement_prediction_flip": float(rho_flip_row["coefficient"]),
        "rho_disagreement_prediction_flip_ci": [float(rho_flip_row["bootstrap_ci_low"]), float(rho_flip_row["bootstrap_ci_high"])],
        "rho_disagreement_miou_drop": float(rho_miou_row["coefficient"]),
        "rho_disagreement_miou_drop_ci": [float(rho_miou_row["bootstrap_ci_low"]), float(rho_miou_row["bootstrap_ci_high"])],
        "full_miou_drop": float(task["w4a4_input_qif"]["miou"] - task["fp_qif"]["miou"]),
        "full_miou_drop_ci": [-float(percentile_ci(miou_boot)[1]), -float(percentile_ci(miou_boot)[0])],
        "observable_w4a4_distortion": bool(summary["preregistered_decision"]["observable_w4a4_distortion"]),
        "coupled_superadditive_distortion": bool(summary["preregistered_decision"]["coupled_superadditive_distortion"]),
        "patch_count": int(manifest["completed_patches"]),
        "source_count": len(sources),
        "active_layer_count": int(len(layer_stats)),
        "bootstrap_replicates": BOOTSTRAP_REPLICATES,
        "bootstrap_seed": BOOTSTRAP_SEED,
    }

    write_csv(representation, "representation_statistics.csv")
    write_csv(stage_stats, "stage_statistics.csv")
    write_csv(layer_stats, "layer_statistics.csv")
    write_csv(layer_quantiles, "layer_quantiles.csv")
    write_csv(source_stats, "source_statistics.csv")
    write_csv(correlations, "correlation_statistics.csv")
    write_csv(class_stats, "class_statistics.csv")
    write_csv(contrasts, "contrast_statistics.csv")

    analysis_summary = {
        "generated_at": datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat().replace("+00:00", "Z"),
        "scope": {
            "patch_count": findings["patch_count"],
            "source_count": findings["source_count"],
            "active_layer_count": findings["active_layer_count"],
            "bootstrap_replicates": BOOTSTRAP_REPLICATES,
            "bootstrap_seed": BOOTSTRAP_SEED,
            "primary_metric": manifest["protocol"]["primary_metric"],
            "statistical_unit": manifest["protocol"]["statistical_unit"],
        },
        "findings": findings,
        "representation": rounded_records(representation),
        "contrasts": rounded_records(contrasts),
        "correlations": rounded_records(correlations),
        "class_statistics": rounded_records(class_stats),
        "top_layers": rounded_records(layer_stats.sort_values("d_w4a4", ascending=False).head(12)),
    }
    (HERE / "analysis_summary.json").write_text(
        json.dumps(analysis_summary, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + "\n",
        encoding="utf-8",
    )
    build_artifact(
        representation,
        stage_stats,
        layer_stats,
        source_stats,
        class_stats,
        correlations,
        findings,
    )
    if write_notebook:
        build_notebook()


if __name__ == "__main__":
    import argparse

    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser()
    parser.add_argument("--no-notebook", action="store_true")
    arguments = parser.parse_args()
    run(write_notebook=not arguments.no_notebook)
